# Desktop shell — top bar + session sidebar + workspace
# Status: proposed
# Design system: DESIGN-SYSTEM.md (Linear-inspired, single canvas)

id: desktop-shell-layout
version: 1
status: proposed
title: Persistent top bar with session-only sidebar

goal: >
  Maximize horizontal and vertical space for the agent workspace by moving
  global chrome (repo scope, sidebar toggle) into a slim persistent header and
  restricting the collapsible sidebar to session navigation only.

regions:
  - id: top_bar
    position: top
    height: h-10
    persist: true
    border: border-b border-border/50
    background: background
    children:
      - id: sidebar_toggle
        align: start
        order: 1
        control: Sidebar.Trigger
        shortcut: Cmd+B
      - id: repo_selector
        align: start
        order: 2
        control: RepoDropdown
        note: Switches active workspace repo for the entire app inset
      - id: top_bar_actions
        align: end
        order: 3
        optional: true
        items:
          - command_menu_trigger
          - context_inspector_toggle
          - session_diff_toggle
          - pi_status_compact

  - id: body
    position: below top_bar
    flex: flex-1 min-h-0
    children:
      - id: session_sidebar
        position: left
        width_expanded: 15rem
        width_collapsed: 3rem
        collapsible: true
        variant: offcanvas
        purpose: session_navigation_only
        note: No repo tree in sidebar header; repos live in top bar dropdown

      - id: main_inset
        position: center
        flex: flex-1 min-w-0
        children:
          - id: workspace_route
            routes: [/, /workspace]
            children:
              - id: workspace_header_optional
                note: >
                  May merge session title / git chip into top_bar later;
                  initially keep minimal route header or fold into top bar phase 2
              - id: agent_workspace
                flex: flex-1
                contains:
                  - transcript
                  - floating_prompt_composer
              - id: right_inspector
                width: 22rem-28rem
                modes: [context, diff]
                mutually_exclusive: true
                collapsible: true

  - id: settings_route
    route: /settings
    pattern: settings_split
    note: Unchanged pattern; top bar may show "Settings" label instead of repo dropdown

layout_delta_from_current:
  removed_from_sidebar:
    - repo_list_as_primary_navigation
    - sidebar_top_actions_that_duplicate_top_bar
  moved_to_top_bar:
    - sidebar_toggle
    - active_repo_dropdown
  sidebar_becomes:
    - flat_or_grouped_session_list_for_active_repo_only
    - new_session_button
    - search_sessions_optional

acceptance:
  - Top bar visible on workspace routes without scrolling away
  - Toggling sidebar does not change selected repo
  - Workspace transcript area gains width equal to former repo tree chrome in sidebar
  - Inspector behavior and shortcuts (Cmd+I, Cmd+D) unchanged unless spec updated

open_questions:
  - id: session_title_location
    options: [top_bar_center, slim_strip_below_top_bar, floating_in_transcript]
  - id: landing_route
    question: Does / show top bar + empty sidebar or full-bleed landing?
  - id: multi_repo_sessions_visible
    question: When switching repo via dropdown, close inspector or preserve per-repo?
